            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babaandu benywe ne bareeba bali, ‘Siina sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe nakhukholeele efwe bibiindu bino bioosi?’ Mubaboolela muli, ‘Sikila enywe mwandekha ese mala mwasaaya bawele be chikholo chichiindi mu sibala sienywe. Nono mukhakholele baakwa mu sibala siikhali sisienywe tawe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
